#~ "h2><h3>Documentation</h3><p>You can find VLC documentation on VideoLAN's "
#~ "<a href=\"http://wiki.videolan.org\">wiki</a> website.</p><p>If you are a "
#~ "newcomer to VLC media player, please read the<br><a href=\"http://"
